  "description": "AION 2 step-by-step guide for The Aetherium (Miguel, 18 Oct 2026): what opens and what to do at each level, which content each item level enters, and the weekly loop at the level cap. Facts from the AION2 Wiki (Fandom, an open wiki) are in our own words with the page as the source; nothing is copied. A step whose level is already in progression.json names that fact (fact, and pick for one entry of a list) and takes its level and source from it. Status: confirmed (two sources agree, or seen in game), reported (one source) or unknown.",
